From 7af1abc31c9c21c2742d97028c46c10094e3531c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: error-path <95665869+error-path@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 13:51:17 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(signals): Kamei ent, age, nuc and sexp signals

diffusion.entropy, history.file_age, history.unique_changes and
expertise.subsystem follow Kamei et al.'s JIT metrics, point-in-time like
the other history signals, with small default weights and plausible ranges
for the gate's unknown worst case.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
